  "notes": "Used exclusively for periodical publications (magazines, newspapers, journals). For the first edition of a standalone book, use {初版|しょはん}.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{創刊|そうかん}{号|ごう} (inaugural issue)\n・{創刊|そうかん}する (to launch a publication)\n・{創刊|そうかん}から〜{年|ねん} (~ years since founding)\n・{創刊|そうかん}{記念|きねん} (anniversary of founding)",
